{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local network llm ownership tradeoff local network llm ownership tradeoff","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md","fileName":"Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local LLM Network Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local network llm ownership tradeoff local network llm ownership tradeoff","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md","fileName":"Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff","heading":"Local Network LLM Ownership Tradeoff","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Hosting a network-focused language model locally can keep configuration data under organizational control, support offline use, and permit a wider choice of models. It also changes the decision from consuming a managed service to operating a software and hardware stack.\n\nThe operator becomes responsible for model licenses, storage, processors, memory, container images, upgrades, access controls, availability, and monitoring. Local execution is therefore not automatically cheaper or safer. The value depends on whether privacy, customization, or availability benefits justify the new operatio